meta {
  name: Generate Next Barcode
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/products/next-barcode
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Generate Next Barcode

  Generates the next available barcode for a new product.

  ## How It Works

  1. Reads current barcode counter from StoreSettings
  2. Increments counter
  3. Returns formatted barcode: `{storeCode}{counter:D10}`

  ## Response

  ```json
  {
    "barcode": "10000000001"
  }
  ```

  ## Notes

  - Each store has its own barcode counter
  - Store code is prefixed to ensure uniqueness across stores
  - Counter is auto-incremented on each call

  ## Authorization

  Requires `products.manage` capability (Manager, Admin).
}
